# Committed credential docs (history rotated separately)
LOGIN_CREDENTIALS.md
USER_CREDENTIALS.md

# Client working files — spreadsheets, decks, archives. These arrive by email,
# get superseded weekly, and bloat the repo; the seeders are the source of truth
# for what they contain.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z

# ...except the product documentation already versioned under docs/, which is
# deliberate. New files there still need `git add -f` if they match the above.
!docs/**
!consumer-web/docs/**

# Postman collection + its load-test script: local API tooling, not source.
postman/
